// How long a month and a year are, how fast the clock may run, and the date
// the world opens on.
//
// Every month is the same length and there are no leap days, so a year is
// simply days_per_month * months_per_year — 360 days here. Both must be at
// least 1.
//
// `speeds` is simulated days per real second. `+` and `-` step through the
// list, slowest first, and the game starts on the first entry. Add or remove
// entries freely; no zeroes.
//
// `start` is the date the world opens on. 1066.1.1 — the year of the
// Conquest — by default. Pick any year a mod likes.
//
// A mod that wants ten-day months ships a folder with just this file in it.
(
    calendar: (
        days_per_month: 30,
        months_per_year: 12,
        speeds: [1, 3, 6, 15],
        start: (year: 1066, month: 1, day: 1),
    ),
)
